			"notes": "- Full rewrite to **Mojang mappings**.\n- Mod renamed from **Pebbles** to **Pebbles & Twigs**.\n- Added new **pebble variants**: Andesite, Diorite, Granite, Deepslate, Tuff, Blackstone, and End Stone.\n- Added **Twig system** with multiple wood variants.\n- Twigs can be placed **vertically or horizontally** depending on placement direction.\n- Twigs can be **stripped with an axe**, creating stripped twig variants.\n- Expanded **world generation** for pebbles and twigs across multiple biomes and environments.\n- Pebbles and Twigs now support **waterlogging** and improved environmental interactions."
		},
